#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-improvements.md:10
msgid ""
"本页由 {download}`实施台账 <documentation-system-execution.csv>` 派生。任务、依赖、 实现和验收值以该"
" CSV 为唯一权威；原编号及退出条件不因状态更新改变。 源 "
"SHA-256：`d1f5adad33468cb83c2849b9ec5176d10d958db044620943e93fb0d02d6a2c77`。同一生成器在"
" commit／CI 检查缺失或陈旧视图。"
msgstr ""
"This page derives from the {download}`implementation ledger <documentation-"
"system-execution.csv>`. That CSV is the sole authority for tasks, "
"dependencies, implementation and acceptance values; status updates do not "
"change original IDs or exit conditions. Source SHA-256: "
"`d1f5adad33468cb83c2849b9ec5176d10d958db044620943e93fb0d02d6a2c77`. The same"
" generator checks missing/stale views at commit and CI."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-improvements.md:14
msgid "当前实现与验收"
