#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-improvements.md:16
msgid ""
"`implemented` 表示页面、工具、门禁或交付路径已实现； `development_passed` "
"表示实际开发检查，不自动建立正式发布或退出验收。 `pending_formal_evidence` 要等待精确 clean-"
"source、部署、恢复或独立审查记录。 实际记录与取得范围见 [文档验收入口](../status/documentation-"
"acceptance.md)； [逐项原字段](../status/ledgers/documentation-"
"system.md)保留全部状态和证据定位。"
msgstr ""
"`implemented` means a page, tool, gate or delivery path exists; "
"`development_passed` records actual development checks without formal "
"release/exit qualification. `pending_formal_evidence` awaits exact clean-"
"source, deployment, restoration or independent-review records. See "
"[documentation acceptance](../status/documentation-acceptance.md) for actual"
" records/scope and [original per-item "
"fields](../status/ledgers/documentation-system.md) for all states/evidence "
"locations."

