#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-improvements.md:28
msgid ""
"预览、软件模型、图源存在或成功渲染不能替代公开部署、物理 HIL 或产品资格。 文档包和证据归档分别绑定同一次交付；未实际取得的摘要与 locator "
"不编造。"
msgstr ""
"Previews, software models, diagram sources and successful rendering do not "
"replace public deployment, physical HIL or product qualification. "
"Documentation packages and evidence archives bind the same delivery; never "
"invent unacquired digests or locators."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/documentation-improvements.md:31
msgid ""
"P1 优先完成，P2 也属于交付范围。责任统一为 Codex，独立 agent 参与评审。 新增和修改正文遵守 "
"[内容与图示标准](documentation-standards.md)和 [页面模板](documentation-"
"templates.md)，图册见 [15 类必需图](../assets/diagrams/README.md)。 D1 至 D6 "
"是工作包，顺序以依赖为准；不累加其他专项台账的任务或验收次数。"
msgstr ""
"Prioritize P1; P2 is also delivery scope. Codex owns responsibility with "
"independent agent review. New/changed prose follows [content/diagram "
"standards](documentation-standards.md) and [page templates](documentation-"
"templates.md); see the [15 required diagram "
"classes](../assets/diagrams/README.md). D1–D6 are dependency-ordered work "
"packages, without aggregating other ledgers’ task or acceptance counts."

